This repository contains mesh files copied from [Universal_Robots_ROS2_Description](https://github.com/UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_ROS2_Description) repository of Universal Robots. The files that are directly copied are:
```
├── UR10
│   └── BasicMeshes
│       ├── base_collider.stl
│       ├── forearm_collider.stl
│       ├── shoulder_collider.stl
│       ├── upperarm_collider.stl
│       ├── wrist1_collider.stl
│       ├── wrist2_collider.stl
│       └── wrist3_collider.stl
└── UR20
    └── BasicMeshes
        ├── base.stl
        ├── forearm.stl
        ├── shoulder.stl
        ├── upperarm.stl
        ├── wrist1.stl
        ├── wrist2.stl
        └── wrist3.stl
```

Additionally, mesh files in `.fbx` format stored in this repository are based on the meshes listed above.

